WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.286
Two fixes, two different times.

00:00:02.913 --> 00:00:04.318
First, during copying.

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:07.453
DNA polymerase adds a wrong base.

00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:09.368
It catches it and swaps it out

00:00:09.415 --> 00:00:10.111
right away.

00:00:10.645 --> 00:00:11.655
That's proofreading.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.594
Now copying is finished.

00:00:14.442 --> 00:00:16.520
Repair proteins scan the new DNA.

00:00:17.147 --> 00:00:18.924
They find a mismatch, cut it out,

00:00:18.982 --> 00:00:19.795
and replace it.

00:00:20.421 --> 00:00:21.652
That's mismatch repair.

00:00:22.047 --> 00:00:24.113
Like checking as you write, then rereading

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:24.578
after.

00:00:25.205 --> 00:00:26.574
Now try the question again.
